# ============================================
# SECURITY NOTES
# ============================================
# 1. NEVER commit this file with real values to Git
# 2. Use Render's "Secret Files" feature for extra sensitive data
# 3. Rotate all API keys and passwords after deployment
# 4. Use Render Environment Groups to share secrets across services
# 5. Enable "Auto-Deploy" in Render for automatic updates on Git push

# ============================================
# HOW TO SET IN RENDER DASHBOARD
# ============================================
# 1. Go to: https://dashboard.render.com
# 2. Select your service (e.g., healthcare-backend)
# 3. Click "Environment" in the left sidebar
# 4. Click "Add Environment Variable"
# 5. Enter Key and Value
# 6. Click "Save Changes" (service will auto-redeploy)

# For variables marked "sync: false" in render.yaml:
# - These will prompt you during initial deployment
# - Or add them manually in the dashboard after deployment
